msgid ""
"The sensor can be connected to any available serial/uart port on the "
"autopilot.  In the diagram below the first sensor is connected to SERIAL2."
msgstr "该传感器可连接到飞控上任意可用的串口/UART 接口。在下方示意图中，第一个传感器连接到 SERIAL2。"

